 "caveat": "NASA chose these nine regions for Artemis III. Artemis III is now planned as a crewed test flight in Earth orbit (mid-2027), and the first crewed landing moved to Artemis IV (2028). NASA says the nine regions do not decide where Artemis IV and later missions land; those may open up more of the south polar region. No Artemis IV site had been chosen as of November 2026.",
